<article id="single-blocks" class="single-blog-article wpex-first-mt-0 wpex-clr">
<header class="single-blog-header wpex-mb-10">
	<h1 class="single-post-title entry-title wpex-m-0 wpex-text-3xl">Margaux&#039;s Medals: Best Restaurants of 2012</h1>
</header>
<div class="single-blog-content single-content entry wpex-mt-20 wpex-mb-40 wpex-clr"><p>We&#8217;re people pleasers&#8230;<br />
And nothing pleases us more than to hear that we&#8217;re doing it right!<br />
A big shout our of appreciation and gratitude to restaurant critic Greg Cox for honoring us with a Silver Medal on his list of Best Restaurants of 2012!  We know that there are a lot of great restaurants in the area, and we&#8217;re humbled and honored to be included on his picks of the best!<br />
We hope that we&#8217;ll stay on your list of favorites, too<br />
<a rel="attachment wp-att-1227" href="/blog/margauxs-medals-best-restaurants-of-2012/attachment/silvermedal-2"><img decoding="async" class="alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-1227" title="silverMedal" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20130%20130'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" width="130" height="130" data-lazy-src="/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/silverMedal1-130x130.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-1227" title="silverMedal" src="/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/silverMedal1-130x130.png" alt="" width="130" height="130" /></noscript></a><br />
<a href="/?attachment_id=1226"></a></p>
</div>


